	<picker mode="selector" range="{{roundingOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{roundingIndex}}" bindchange="onRoundingChange"><view class="picker">不满一档时怎么处理？{{roundingOptions[roundingIndex].label}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
	<picker mode="selector" range="{{roundingScopeOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].rounding.scope === 'session' ? 1 : 0}}" bindchange="onRoundingScopeChange"><view class="picker">是每天一起算，还是每场分开算？{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].rounding.scope === 'session' ? '每场分开' : '每天合计'}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{capOrderOptions}}" range-key="label" data-field="cap_order" bindchange="onRulePicker"><view class="picker">先取整还是先限制最高时长？{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].cap_order === 'cap_then_round' ? '先限制再取整' : '先取整再限制'}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
    <view class="row"><text>一场最多算</text><input type="digit" data-field="session_cap" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(document.day_rules[selectedDayType].session_cap_minutes)}}" bindinput="onNumberInput" placeholder="不限制" /><text>小时</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text>一天最多算</text><input type="digit" data-field="daily_cap" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(document.day_rules[selectedDayType].daily_cap_minutes)}}" bindinput="onNumberInput" placeholder="不限制" /><text>小时</text></view>
    <view class="row"><text>一个月最多算</text><input type="digit" data-field="monthly_cap" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(document.day_rules[selectedDayType].monthly_cap_minutes)}}" bindinput="onNumberInput" placeholder="不限制" /><text>小时</text></view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{nightBasisOptions}}" range-key="label" data-field="night_day_basis" bindchange="onRulePicker"><view class="picker">如果加班到凌晨，算哪一天？{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].night_day_basis === 'shift_start' ? '都算到开始那天' : '按日期拆开'}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
  </view>

  </view>

  <view id="guide-pricingBands" class="panel guide-target pricing-panel {{guideOpen && guideItem.target === 'pricingBands' ? 'guide-target-active' : ''}}" wx:if="{{!loading && document && currentStep === 2}}">
    <view class="panel-title panel-title-with-status"><text>不同加班时段分别怎么算钱？</text><text wx:if="{{pricingNeedsAttention}}" class="attention-badge">未设置小时单价</text></view>
    <text class="section-help">这里就是加班单价设置。你可以按累计时长、钟点时段或当天第几场加班分别填写每小时多少钱。</text>
    <view class="pricing-alert" wx:if="{{pricingNeedsAttention}}"><text class="pricing-alert-title">请先设置加班小时单价</text><text class="pricing-alert-body">当前分类还没有可用的加班小时单价。请先填写“每小时多少钱”；如果确定暂时不计算加班费，可以直接跳过。</text><view class="pricing-alert-actions"><button class="tiny pricing-set-button" bindtap="startPricingSetup">现在设置单价</button><button class="tiny pricing-skip-button" bindtap="skipPricingSetupAndContinue">暂不设置，继续下一步</button></view></view>
    <view class="pricing-skipped" wx:elif="{{pricingSkipConfirmed}}"><text class="pricing-skipped-title">已确认暂不设置小时单价</text><text class="hint">这一类加班仍可统计时长，但加班费会按 0 元处理。之后可以点击“现在设置单价”补充。</text><button class="tiny pricing-set-button" bindtap="startPricingSetup">现在设置单价</button></view>
    <view class="empty-pricing" wx:if="{{!document.day_rules[selectedDayType].bands.length && !pricingSkipConfirmed}}"><text class="empty-pricing-title">还没有设置这一类日子的加班单价</text><text class="hint">点击上面的“现在设置单价”，会直接展开第一段小时单价输入；工作日、休息日和法定节假日要分别设置。</text></view>
    <view class="coach-inline" wx:if="{{guideOpen && guideItem.target === 'pricingBands'}}"><text class="coach-progress">引导 {{guideIndex + 1}} / {{guideCount}}</text><text class="coach-title">{{guideItem.title}}</text><text class="coach-body">{{guideItem.body}}</text><view class="coach-actions"><button class="coach-skip" bindtap="skipGuide">跳过</button><button class="coach-next" bindtap="nextGuide">{{guideIndex + 1 >= guideCount ? '知道了' : '下一条'}}</button></view></view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{pricingModeOptions}}" range-key="label" data-field="pricing_mode" bindchange="onRulePicker"><view class="picker question-picker"><text class="picker-question">同一天符合多段时怎么计算？</text><view class="picker-answer"><text>{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].pricing_mode === 'single_tier' ? '只用排在最前的一段' : '每段分别计算'}}</text><text class="picker-chevron">›</text></view></view></picker>
    <view class="config-item" wx:for="{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].bands}}" wx:key="id" wx:for-item="band" wx:for-index="bandIndex">
      <view class="item-head"><input class="item-name" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="name" value="{{band.name}}" bindinput="onBandInput" placeholder="分段名称" /><button class="tiny danger" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindtap="removePricingBand">删除</button></view>
      <view class="pricing-rate-block" wx:if="{{band.settlement !== 'comp_time'}}"><text class="pricing-rate-label">优先填写：加班小时单价</text><picker mode="selector" range="{{rateModeOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{band.rate.mode === 'formula' ? 1 : 0}}" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindchange="onBandRateMode"><view class="picker question-picker"><text class="picker-question">每小时多少钱？</text><view class="picker-answer"><text>{{band.rate.mode === 'formula' ? '根据工资自动计算' : '我直接填写金额'}}</text><text class="picker-chevron">›</text></view></view></picker><view class="mini-field rate-input-field" wx:if="{{band.rate.mode !== 'formula'}}"><text>这段每小时多少钱？</text><view class="input-with-unit"><input type="digit" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="rate" value="{{band.rate.cents_per_hour / 100}}" bindinput="onBandInput" /><text>元</text></view></view></view>
      <view class="formula-box" wx:if="{{band.settlement !== 'comp_time' && band.rate.mode === 'formula'}}">
        <picker mode="selector" range="{{formulaVariableOptions}}" range-key="label" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindchange="onFormulaStartPicker"><view class="picker">先从哪项金额开始算？{{band.rate.formula.start_label}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
        <view class="formula-step" wx:for="{{band.rate.formula.steps}}" wx:for-item="step" wx:for-index="stepIndex">
          <picker mode="selector" range="{{formulaOperatorOptions}}" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-step-index="{{stepIndex}}" data-field="operator" bindchange="onFormulaStepPicker"><view class="picker compact">{{step.operator}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
          <picker mode="selector" range="{{formulaOperandOptions}}" range-key="label" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-step-index="{{stepIndex}}" data-field="operand_kind" bindchange="onFormulaStepPicker"><view class="picker compact">{{step.operand_kind_label}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
          <picker wx:if="{{step.operand.kind === 'variable'}}" mode="selector" range="{{formulaVariableOptions}}" range-key="label" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-step-index="{{stepIndex}}" data-field="operand_variable" bindchange="onFormulaStepPicker"><view class="picker formula-value">{{step.operand_label}} <text>›</text></view></picker>
          <input wx:else class="formula-value" type="digit" value="{{step.operand.value}}" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-step-index="{{stepIndex}}" bindinput="onFormulaStepNumber" />
          <button class="icon-button danger" aria-label="删除公式步骤" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-step-index="{{stepIndex}}" bindtap="removeFormulaStep">×</button>
        </view>
        <button class="formula-add" data-target="band_rate" data-owner-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindtap="addFormulaStep">添加运算步骤</button>
        <text class="hint">算出的结果就是每小时的加班单价。例如：加班工资基数 ÷ 月标准出勤天数 ÷ 每日标准工时。</text>
      </view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{pricingSelectorOptions}}" range-key="label" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindchange="onBandSelector"><view class="picker question-picker"><text class="picker-question">这一段按什么条件判断？</text><view class="picker-answer"><text>{{band.selector_label}}</text><text class="picker-chevron">›</text></view></view></picker>
      <block wx:if="{{band.selector === 'cumulative_range'}}">
        <view class="rule-grid"><view class="mini-field"><text>从累计第几小时开始？</text><input type="digit" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="min_minutes" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(band.min_minutes)}}" bindinput="onBandInput" /></view><view class="mini-field"><text>到累计第几小时结束？</text><input type="digit" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="max_minutes" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(band.max_minutes)}}" bindinput="onBandInput" placeholder="不封顶" /></view></view>
      </block>
      <block wx:elif="{{band.selector === 'clock_window'}}">
        <view class="time-grid"><picker mode="time" value="{{band.clock_start_text}}" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="clock_start_minute" bindchange="onBandClockTime"><view class="picker compact">开始 {{band.clock_start_text}} <text>›</text></view></picker><picker mode="time" value="{{band.clock_end_text}}" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="clock_end_minute" bindchange="onBandClockTime"><view class="picker compact">结束 {{band.clock_end_text}} <text>›</text></view></picker></view>
        <text class="hint">例如 22:00 到 02:00，会自动理解为跨到第二天。</text>
      </block>
      <block wx:else>
        <view class="rule-grid"><view class="mini-field"><text>起始场次</text><input type="number" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="min_session" value="{{band.min_session || 1}}" bindinput="onBandInput" /></view><view class="mini-field"><text>结束场次</text><input type="number" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="max_session" value="{{band.max_session === null ? '' : band.max_session}}" bindinput="onBandInput" placeholder="不封顶" /></view></view>
      </block>
      <view class="rule-grid" wx:if="{{band.selector !== 'clock_window'}}"><view class="switch-mini"><text>含起点</text><switch checked="{{band.min_inclusive}}" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="min_inclusive" bindchange="onBandSwitch" color="#4ECDC4" /></view><view class="switch-mini"><text>含终点</text><switch checked="{{band.max_inclusive}}" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="max_inclusive" bindchange="onBandSwitch" color="#4ECDC4" /></view></view>
      <view class="rule-grid"><view class="mini-field"><text>这一段最多算几小时？</text><input type="digit" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="band_cap_minutes" value="{{durationUnit.optionalHours(band.band_cap_minutes)}}" bindinput="onBandInput" placeholder="不限制" /></view><view class="mini-field"><text>同时符合多段时，先用哪段？数字越大越靠前</text><input type="number" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="priority" value="{{band.priority}}" bindinput="onBandInput" /></view></view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{settlementModeOptions}}" range-key="label" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" bindchange="onBandSettlement"><view class="picker question-picker"><text class="picker-question">这段加班怎么结算？</text><view class="picker-answer"><text>{{band.settlement_label}}</text><text class="picker-chevron">›</text></view></view></picker>
      <view class="row" wx:if="{{band.settlement === 'comp_time'}}"><text>1 小时换多少小时调休？</text><input type="digit" data-index="{{bandIndex}}" data-field="comp_time_ratio" value="{{band.comp_time_ratio}}" bindinput="onBandInput" /><text>小时</text></view>
    </view>
    <button class="secondary add-item" bindtap="addPricingBand">{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].bands.length ? '再添加一段加班单价' : '添加第一段加班单价'}}</button>
    <view class="switch-row"><text>确认分段空档固定按 0 元</text><switch checked="{{document.day_rules[selectedDayType].gap_confirmed}}" bindchange="onGapConfirmedChange" color="#4ECDC4" /></view>
    <text class="hint">同一种判断方式不能互相重叠；如果中间故意留空，确认后那段时间按 0 元算。</text>
