	<view id="guide-salaryItems" class="subsection guide-target {{guideOpen && guideItem.target === 'salaryItems' ? 'guide-target-active' : ''}}"><view class="subsection-head"><text>你还需要哪些补贴？</text></view><view class="preset-actions"><picker mode="selector" range="{{salaryPresetOptions}}" range-key="label" value="{{salaryPresetIndex}}" bindchange="onSalaryPresetChange"><view class="picker compact">{{salaryPresetOptions[salaryPresetIndex].label}} <text>›</text></view></picker><button class="tiny preset-add-button {{salaryPresetAlreadyAdded ? 'preset-add-button-disabled' : ''}}" disabled="{{salaryPresetAlreadyAdded}}" bindtap="addSalaryPreset">{{salaryPresetAlreadyAdded ? '已添加' : '添加这个项目'}}</button></view><text class="hint">选一个你会拿到的补贴，再填写金额和什么时候生效。</text></view>
